464XLAT CLAT (RFC 6877) for uplinks that carry IPv6
only.  It runs tayga on a virtual WAN interface, so that the IPv4
gateway, the default route and outbound NAT are provided by the
normal firewall machinery.  The NAT64 prefix is discovered
automatically from router advertisements (PREF64, RFC 8781) and
through DNS (RFC 7050), and the CLAT activates only while the
firewall has no native IPv4.

